# Deleting a project in the outline drops its starred tasks from the Starred view in the other pane.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report @star
	Launch:
		- Venue @star
		- Catering @star
END
keys <C-g>
type starred
keys <C-t>
see │▌ - Report
keys <C-w> h j j dd
hide Venue
hide Catering
see - Report 󰓎  Work
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report @star
END
